---
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer class="w-full rounded-t-none bg-primary text-[#e6fff4]">
	<div class="mx-auto grid w-full max-w-7xl grid-cols-1 gap-12 px-8 py-20 md:grid-cols-4">
		<div class="md:col-span-1">
			<span class="font-headline text-xl font-black uppercase tracking-widest text-[#e6fff4]"
				>AdriaIntel</span
			>
			<p class="mt-6 font-body text-sm leading-relaxed text-[#e6fff4]/80">
				Elevating maritime decision-making through coastal intelligence and bespoke data analysis.
			</p>
		</div>
		<div class="space-y-6">
			<h4 class="font-headline text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-white">Exploration</h4>
			<nav class="flex flex-col space-y-4">
				<a class="text-sm text-[#e6fff4]/80 transition-all hover:text-white" href="/">Home</a>
				<a class="text-sm text-[#e6fff4]/80 transition-all hover:text-white" href="/articles"
					>Maritime Insights</a
				>
				<a class="text-sm text-[#e6fff4]/80 transition-all hover:text-white" href="/contact"
					>Contact</a
				>
			</nav>
		</div>
		<div class="space-y-6">
			<h4 class="font-headline text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-white">Legal</h4>
			<nav class="flex flex-col space-y-4">
				<a class="text-sm text-[#e6fff4]/80 transition-all hover:text-white" href="#">Privacy Policy</a>
				<a class="text-sm text-[#e6fff4]/80 transition-all hover:text-white" href="#"
					>Terms of Service</a
				>
			</nav>
		</div>
		<div class="space-y-6">
			<h4 class="font-headline text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-white">Connect</h4>
			<div class="flex gap-4">
				<a class="text-[#e6fff4]/80 transition-all hover:text-white" href="#" aria-label="Email"
					><span class="material-symbols-outlined">alternate_email</span></a
				>
				<a class="text-[#e6fff4]/80 transition-all hover:text-white" href="#" aria-label="Web"
					><span class="material-symbols-outlined">public</span></a
				>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
	<div class="border-t border-white/5 py-8 text-center">
		<p class="font-body text-xs text-[#e6fff4]/40">
			© {year} AdriaIntel. Coastal Precision, Global Expertise.
		</p>
	</div>
</footer>
